</div></nav></header><noscript id="no-script-navigation"><nav aria-label="Navigation without JavaScript" class="l-nojs-nav"><a href="/GhostHeart_Story.html">Story</a><a href="/music/index.html">Music &amp; films</a><a href="/follow/index.html">Follow by email</a><a href="/GhostHeart_Resources.html">Find support</a></nav></noscript><main id="main-content"><span aria-hidden="true" class="l-anchor-alias" id="vault-title"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="l-anchor-alias" id="hero-title"></span><section class="g-section g-page-top"><div class="g-wrap"><p class="g-kicker">Words to carry</p><h1>Find the line<br/><em>that finds you.</em></h1><p class="g-lead">The existing words, kept as written. Search, carry a quote, or share its direct link.</p></div></section><section class="g-section" id="quote-archive"><div class="g-wrap"><div class="l-filter" data-quote-controls="" hidden=""><label for="quote-search">Search these quotes</label><div><input autocomplete="off" id="quote-search" placeholder="Try love, strength, fire…" type="search"/><button id="clear-search" type="button">Clear search</button></div><p aria-live="polite" id="result-count" role="status"></p></div><div class="l-quotes" id="quote-grid"><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-01" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">Equality isn’t given; it’s reborn in the hearts of those who refuse to let it die.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 01</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-02" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">You can’t fight what you don’t face.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 02</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-03" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">When the promise breaks, the heart must carry it.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 03</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-04" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">They call it rebellion when you love who you want.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 04</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-05" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">You can’t close a revolving door, but you can get out.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 05</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-06" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">You can burn every bridge behind you, but ashes don’t rebuild paths.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 06</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-07" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">When the fire dies, silence becomes the loudest scream.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 07</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-08" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">I gave my life so yours could live—the heart that glows is the one that gave.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 08</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-09" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">Some bonds burn brighter... until they consume you.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 09</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-10" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">Everyone has something to say, but gets real quiet when it’s their turn.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 10</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-11" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">It doesn’t matter what they say; they couldn’t handle it anyway.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 11</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-12" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">I can’t draw or sing, but these are my words, and I say what I mean.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 12</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-13" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">Strength is quiet until it roars.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 13</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-14" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">Even broken steel remembers first.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 14</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-15" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">Love doesn’t ask permission to exist.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 15</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-16" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">Truth dances in silence.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 16</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article><article class="l-quote" data-quote="" id="quote-17" tabindex="-1"><blockquote class="q-text">Reflection is rebellion.</blockquote><p class="g-small">GhostHeart · 17</p><div data-quote-actions="" hidden=""><button data-copy-quote="" type="button">Copy quote</button><button data-copy-link="" type="button">Copy link</button></div></article></div><button aria-controls="quote-grid" hidden="" id="show-more" type="button">Show more quotes</button><p aria-live="polite" id="copy-status" role="status"></p></div></section><section class="g-section" id="join-the-signal"><div class="g-wrap"><h2>Stay Connected.</h2>
